DESCRIPTION:European Control Conference (ECC 2027)\n\nPapers submission dea
 dline (extended): 9 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: July 
 13-16\, 2027\nLocation: Brussels\, Belgium\nVenue: UCLouvain\, Woluwé cam
 pus\n\nAll dates:\n  Papers submission deadline (extended): 9 Nov 2026\, 2
 3:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Invited session proposals submission deadline (ex
 tended): 9 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Tutorial proposals submiss
 ion deadline: 31 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Workshop proposals s
 ubmission deadline: 31 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Industry abstr
 acts submission deadline: 31 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Acceptan
 ce/rejection notification: 5 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final su
 bmissions deadline: 5 Apr 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for pa
 pers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could
